      "text": "30 services (2015) \u2192 100+ services meshed, millions of req/sec (Sept 2016) \u2192 thousands of nodes, 2M+ req/sec, every system at Lyft (Sept 2017, CNCF). Istio and AWS App Mesh later adopted Envoy as their own data plane.",
